From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:30:57 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 63/64] Meridian: Arc's mini player and automatic
 picture-in-picture

- Media playing or paused in a tab other than the active one shows above
  the sidebar's bottom bar: track and artist (or the site), previous,
  play/pause, next and picture-in-picture when the page offers them; a
  click goes to the tab (meridian::FindNowPlaying, ControlMedia).
- Browser-initiated automatic picture-in-picture is on, and allowed by
  default: a video playing with sound floats when its tab is left. A site
  can be blocked in the Site Control Center.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
